Package: mikumikupenguin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: MikuMikuDance PMX/VMD viewer for Linux
 MikuMikuPenguin is a library (libmmp) and a demonstration viewer for
 MikuMikuDance (MMD) data.  The viewer, pmx, loads a PMX 2.0 model and plays
 a VMD motion on it with toon shading and Bullet physics, optionally playing
 music through SDL2_mixer.
 .
 An OpenGL 3.3 core profile capable driver is required.

Package: libmmp-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: libgl-dev,
         libglfw3-dev,
         libepoxy-dev,
         libglm-dev,
         libbullet-dev,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: MikuMikuPenguin library (static) and headers
 MikuMikuPenguin (libmmp) loads MikuMikuDance PMX 2.0 models and VMD motions,
 evaluates bone animation and IK, and simulates rigid bodies with Bullet.
 .
 This package contains the static library and the C++ headers
 (installed under /usr/include/libmmp).  The API is not stable.
